{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "49d68b29d1a47aff98857bd15207099a033fb122657f91e3009cc78a1a701d82", "ja": "えっと、さっき届いた箱は……\nあ、これこれ！", "zh": "那个，刚才送到的箱子是……\n啊，就是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "f639ce38ab7060df7348f968c1e1c3096017a840d334b2eecc03012d0446772e", "ja": "これが、アイドルたちの大いなる力……。\n社長さん、なにを送ってきたんだろう？", "zh": "这就是偶像们伟大的力量……  \n社长送来的究竟是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1002_president", "source_sha256": "0557cfd6b00c848b986bfd2843623e23e4aa4e62fc973bfca2f1e3d770487494", "ja": "なにか私を呼ぶ声が聞こえた気がしたが……\n気のせいだったかな？　お疲れさま、青羽君！", "zh": "好像听到有什么声音在叫我……  \n是我听错了吗？辛苦了，青羽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "15572828e17a6d9751c6ea88622dbb7e5233acc7dd8a64f7821a23ed985de16b", "ja": "あっ、お疲れさまです！　社長さんと音無先輩、\n{$P$}さんも！", "zh": "啊，辛苦了！社长、音无前辈，还有{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2086f27d5a1d62e47d06c821b37974c18693c0c76266c23e79bb4a41b8672d0e", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1005_101kot", "source_sha256": "395fc80f71de2bae68dccb19f3c63ff3597ef33684ddfe4a410a553be12b1d43", "ja": "私たちも、ゲネプロを見学させてもらってたの。\nみんな、とっても素敵だったわ～。", "zh": "我们也去旁听了彩排呢。\n大家都好棒哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1006_president", "source_sha256": "8afd68b04d4559513bea36b533b7d9dbf736efd05050d6e3fdb5a3d874651ba3", "ja": "うむ！　実に素晴らしかったね！\n他を寄せつけぬ力強いパフォーマンス……。", "zh": "嗯！真是精彩绝伦啊！\n那股令人难以企及的有力表演……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1007_president", "source_sha256": "67ae1fd1769f0a11e95c4f41387ed38227fe37aad543361af1978b2518a780a7", "ja": "まさしく冷厳と力をモチーフとする、\nSHADE OF SPADEの名に相応しいね！", "zh": "真不愧是以冷峻与力量为主题，\n完全配得上SHADE OF SPADE这个名字呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "a8cd41b852c07df044f884f2b5f11dfdc9655b7871fefdc94ba7c84dcbb1d9fa", "ja": "はい！　西エリアのお客さんも、きっと\nあのパワーに、打ちのめされてしまうはず……！", "zh": "是的！西区的客人们，也一定会被那股力量彻底震撼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "067e7898890c123b1e578d4c7bd960c60a4282b04a15225158e81c391efb1486", "ja": "パワー……そうだ！　社長さん、この荷物なんですけど\n……アイドルたちの大いなる力になるんですか？", "zh": "力量……对了！社长，这些行李是……能成为偶像们强大的力量吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "018ea4ad3a75afeb48e357e3875a369937a1fc75d261552a7d284e056474add4", "ja": "アイドルたちの、大いなる力……？", "zh": "偶像们的强大力量……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "9dea6540edb7738d4b26a15bf17724ba7990943143c6dfb92d627e81a90dc5b7", "ja": "おお、そうだった！\nかさばるし、量も多いから先に送っておいたんだ。", "zh": "哦，对了！因为东西又占地方，量也多，所以我就先寄过去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "c2328689b142cb7bc2cc7e3556d221ba547624fe25a5f238daed366cdd66b0cd", "ja": "君、開けてみてくれたまえ。\nちゃんと電池も買ってきたから、心配無用だよ！", "zh": "你来打开看看吧。\n我也好好把电池买回来了，不用担心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "92356df29d44b7921471b2c6c90003760a8073e5e9011e7e5cce1ce8b27a5037", "ja": "電池で動くんですか？　それじゃ、\n開けてみますね……あっ、これは！", "zh": "是用电池驱动的吗？那我就打开看看……啊，这是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "a7047ac1ff9084d7ee6ceb9009738dc3cf160ea851b6da848efa8491b867126e", "ja": "ハンディファン……。箱の中身は、\n携帯型のミニ扇風機だったんですね！", "zh": "便携式小风扇……箱子里装的原来是便携型迷你电风扇啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "746df839086228209d37b7773cf87af40a2a8ae76f2e4d7bb956c2ffcd71c1ce", "ja": "まだまだ暑い日が続くからね、人数分用意した！\n私からの差し入れだよ！", "zh": "天气还会一直热下去呢，我按人数准备了这些！\n这是我给大家带的慰问品哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6e45d33bb5b195569180a3c0f1d9150d67095db4cc0665e411b4c44dc785e1c2", "ja": "なるほど……これは、熱い日々を駆け抜ける\nアイドルたちの力になってくれそうですね！", "zh": "原来如此……这一定能成为陪伴偶像们度过炎热日子的力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "3c6949167d0e1b6c9f4e8bfa70c4733b21d741001efbea8a936f8884eb53bdbc", "ja": "この時期、便利なんですよね～。\nさすが社長、いいセンスですね♪", "zh": "这个时期用起来很方便呢～。\n不愧是社长，品味真好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "2cfde44767482a9ac51b8880a7aabe7a3d63d511038e08e1cd54d3a7b9ab3e2a", "ja": "ミリオンシアターシーズン、素晴らしい成果を\n残してくれているからね。これくらいは当然だよ！", "zh": "因为你为百万剧场季留下了如此出色的成果。这点奖励当然是应该的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "584c2a839b299a1076c464432c106ee6c8f55195ac9887c0a3698af325e64132", "ja": "社長、ありがとうございます！\nアイドルたちも喜ぶと思います！", "zh": "社长，谢谢您！\n偶像们一定也会很高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1020_102mis", "source_sha256": "e663f2e42d678a321beb9cfbadd362780ee093f95d184e7ef3b1099606606d16", "ja": "これで準備もバッチリ、ですね！\nいよいよシーズンも4つ目……。", "zh": "这样一来准备工作也万无一失了呢！\n终于到了第4个赛季……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "89eeae64cd2a6f2e867c775fdab1e849a6938af6ba4eaaa180da818c3abeac6d", "ja": "ダイヤ、クローバー、ハート。\nどのチームも、素晴らしい集大成ライブでしたね。", "zh": "方块、梅花、红心。\n每个团队都带来了精彩的收官演出呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "fcf02c4b3db95248ef1eaa083e887171e74a43bc62b6e5723915aba4eb1d1454", "ja": "うむ。そして今回も、それに劣らぬ、\n素晴らしい集大成ライブになると確信しているよ！", "zh": "嗯。而且我相信，这次也一定会成为一场毫不逊色的精彩集大成演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "f001e3044e7785135ff78607ea115f550a453a648b70ef6d1839f37169f7322d", "ja": "765プロのアイドルたちの、絶大なるパワー……\n西エリアに知らしめてきてくれたまえ！", "zh": "去让西区见识见识，\n765艺能的偶像们那无比强大的力量吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "59e2d5bc6ed36343aa3049057b067d982610e341ab83a075aaaed64205b95122", "ja": "はい！　765プロみんなの力で、\n西エリアを席巻してみせます！", "zh": "好的！靠765事务所大家的力量，席卷西部区域给您看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
